Seems smarter to drop the protection racket idea once you get luck like
this.  Once you have some equipment to make it easy to survive the few
levels in between when you get protection via the racket and when you'd
get it anyway, you really want to minimize the risk of being taken out
by a one-shot trap/wand or a couple unlucky rolls of the dice.  The
racket really punishes you on those.

In that situation, I'd head directly to sokoban to try for reflection,
and I'd level up.

Unless, of course, you're going for pacifist, then ignore the above.
Though I suppose you'd have tried for an archon in that case.



